1
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:43,600
Snail...not there, over here.

2
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,680
Honey, the snail won't go home.

3
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,680
Can you help?

4
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:57,440
Honey, the snail won't go home.

5
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,320
Help me fix it.

6
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:04,120
Papa, I stopped it for you.

7
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,960
Come give me a hand.

8
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,320
Hurry up...

9
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:10,240
What now?

10
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:14,160
If the snail doesn't go home, pick it up

11
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:16,080
and put it back in the box.

12
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,160
Simple as that.

13
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:22,480
Why didn't I think of that?

14
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,240
Chung, you didn't need to stop it
with your hand.

15
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,320
If Papa doesn't know, you should.

16
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:30,520
Now I know.

17
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:33,920
OK...stop playing. Pack up your things.

18
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,400
Chi needs to shower

19
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,560
and go to the Day Activity Center (DAC).

20
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,280
OK!

21
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:39,200
Chung, come with me to collect the rent.

22
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,520
OK!

23
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,840
It's so hot,

24
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:47,600
I don't know why country folks
don't trust banks.

25
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:49,240
Why must we collect cash?

26
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,600
We've been doing this for decades.

27
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:54,720
Can't expect grand aunt to go to the bank.

28
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,880
You always sit around
and do nothing all day.

29
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,840
When we ask you to do something...

30
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,600
Chi!

31
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,640
Chi...are you OK?

32
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,720
Chi...
Papa, are you OK?

33
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,760
I'm fine.

34
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,400
How many times did I tell you?

35
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,720
Don't make him put things away.

36
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,640
Don't let him shower himself.

37
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,600
He might slip and fall.

38
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,120
See? He's almost hurt.

39
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:20,160
He said he's fine. Will you relax?

40
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,160
You never let him do anything.

41
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:24,240
Now he can't do anything.

42
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:26,560
He has the IQ of an 8-year-old.

43
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,400
What do you expect him to do?

44
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,880
You're his wife,

45
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:33,120
you're supposed to look after him for life.

46
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:35,160
Exactly! I'm his wife.

47
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,680
I'll decide for him, not you.

48
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,480
I'm his mother and your mother-in-law.

49
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,600
Why can't I decide for him?

50
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,440
I won't let you bully Chi.

51
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,480
I'm not talking to you.

52
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:45,840
Chung, let's go

53
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,000
before she starts calling you a retard

54
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,080
and wants to run your life.

55
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,600
I'm not finished. You abandon Chi again.

56
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,880
Where are you going?

57
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,800
Out. And it's none of your business.

58
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,600
Of course it is! I forbid it.

59
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,160
Out of my way!
You...

60
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:02,640
Grandma...are you OK?
Honey, don't do that...

61
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:05,040
You'll be struck by thunder!
Mom...

62
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,920
What's the racket now?
She should be struck by thunder...

63
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:13,040
Kin-kwok, look! She had the nerve to hit me!

64
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:14,320
If you don't teach her,

65
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,440
I have no place in this house.

66
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:20,480
She only tried to break away and
hit you by mistake.

67
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:24,000
I told you to butt out of their affairs.

68
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,720
But you wouldn't listen.

69
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,640
She doesn't know her place.

70
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:29,440
You should discipline her, not blame me.

71
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,520
Even her son is an adult.

72
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:34,240
You're asking for trouble if you
keep meddling.

73
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:39,360
That's because Chi was born this way.

74
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,760
I won't let anyone bully him.

75
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:45,040
Whoever bullies him will answer to me.

76
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:48,440
Will you stop making such a racket at home?

77
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,800
Ping, Chung, let's go to the village office.

78
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:57,200
Kin-kwok...

79
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:06,000
Chief!
Mrs. Cheung...

80
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:09,520
Uncle Tung, Brother Fa, Grandpa Fat,

81
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:12,720
Mrs. Tsang, Auntie Chu, Uncle Shun,

82
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:13,600
good morning...

83
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,680
Morning...
Good boy!

84
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,920
Why is there a new plaque?

85
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,720
(Noble and Venerable)

86
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:22,080
Your Grandpa helped raise money
for Auntie Nam's medical expenses.

87
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,280
Uncle Nam was very pleased.

88
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:26,000
He sent this plaque in recognition of
his good deed.

89
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,200
That's right!

90
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:30,800
Nam didn't have to. It was nothing.

91
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:33,600
Chung, you've been coming here a lot lately.

92
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,320
Exactly!

93
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,840
He's helping out.

94
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,760
He's old enough to help out.

95
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:41,760
He's so good looking, just like his Mom.

96
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:45,280
Luckily he takes after his Mom
and not his Dad.

97
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:48,080
I want to be like Papa too.

98
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:50,800
Chi is quite smart.

99
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,720
He picked such a good wife

100
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,240
who gave him a good son.

101
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,760
Father...I have invoices for you to sign.

102
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,400
Bring them here.

103
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:03,360
We'll get out of your way...
Bye!

104
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,320
Chung!
Yes?

105
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,560
Bring me those two cartons in the storeroom.

106
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,080
We'll need them when
we worship our ancestors.

107
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:08,960
OK!

108
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,320
Next to the printer...

109
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,200
Chief!
What?

110
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,920
Kwun is waiting for you outside.

111
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:16,880
I'll go out.

112
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:18,560
Watch your step.

113
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,200
Hi, Kin-kwok.

114
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:30,800
What's up? Need any help?

115
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,240
Let's have dinner.

116
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,200
Godfather!

117
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,520
Hi, Chung!

118
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,480
Godfather!

119
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,640
You look so much better.

120
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,920
Putting the crystal cluster in your room

121
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,000
is good for you.

122
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,400
You have a different aura.

123
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:49,040
Really?

124
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,520
Just do as I say.

125
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,920
Call me if you need anything, OK?

126
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,720
I'll help you.

127
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:57,600
She roughed you up?

128
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,520
Daughters-in-law nowadays are ferocious.

129
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,080
I won't put up with it anymore.

130
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:03,400
I will have it out with Kin-kwok tonight.

131
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,720
He indulged the daughter-in-law

132
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,240
and she had the nerve to hit me.

133
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:08,320
What if she starts hitting Chi?

134
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:11,680
I won't let her bully us.

135
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:14,480
Master likes her because she's helpful.

136
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,880
So what?

137
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,800
Before she married into this family,

138
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:21,760
I took care of matters at
the village office.

139
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,840
I will fight her.

140
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,480
I will show her who's in charge.

141
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:29,280
I don't mind having it out with Kin-kwok.

142
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:33,200
Mom, I took a shower.

143
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:37,520
Look at you, your hair is wet.

144
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:40,080
Dry off the body or you'll catch a cold.

145
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:42,400
You should let me bathe you.

146
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,240
Honey said it's better to do it myself.

147
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:47,760
Don't listen to her.

148
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:51,840
Why didn't you put on boxers?

149
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:54,640
I told you to put on boxers.

150
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,640
This one is tight and stuffy.

151
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:59,840
You're sweaty and will have rashes.

152
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,040
Chau!

153
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,720
It wasn't me.

154
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,320
Madam Ping said this is better.

155
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:07,840
Honey said this is more comfortable.

156
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:09,600
You listen to everything she says.

157
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:12,720
What is her intention?

158
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,480
She always opposes me.

159
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:18,640
Chung!

160
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:21,200
Grandpa and I have something to do.

161
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:23,960
Remember last time you collected rent
from great aunt?

162
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,920
This time, after your great aunt,

163
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:28,200
can you collect the rent from someone else?

164
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:31,760
Yes. You taught me.

165
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,360
Hurry up, OK?

166
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,320
OK!

167
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:37,600
Ping, you taught him well.

168
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:41,120
Chung is smarter than Chi,

169
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:44,480
but he still can't compare
to ordinary folks.

170
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,640
He has limited intelligence.

171
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,640
You must teach him to be more independent.

172
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:51,600
Don't spoil him like Han did.

173
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,640
I know.

174
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,080
Sorry!

175
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,960
I missed the bus waiting for you.

176
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,000
Now I must take a taxi.

177
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,640
Are you paying for that?

178
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:16,480
Sorry, I'm really sorry!

179
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:19,200
I'll be on time next time.

180
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:22,600
Wait...because of the No. 8 typhoon signal
a few days ago,

181
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:23,960
the windowsill was leaking,

182
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,000
and all my things got wet.

183
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,520
You should pay for the damages.

184
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,600
I lost over $10k because of it.

185
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:29,520
I'll dock that from this month's rent.

186
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:31,360
What?

187
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:33,520
You must pay your rent on time.

188
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:35,840
It cannot be used to offset anything.

189
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:39,280
I'm the owner Cheung Kin-kwok's counsel.

190
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,400
The leaking of the windowsill

191
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,560
was a condition you were aware of
when you signed the lease.

192
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:45,920
You were in a hurry to open your shop

193
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,240
and refused to let the owner repair it.

194
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,400
It was clearly stated in the lease

195
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:53,280
you're responsible for any loss incurred
because of it.

196
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,920
But since you made it sound so serious,

197
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:59,920
the leaking problem may affect
the structure of the shop.

198
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,920
I will suggest to the owner

199
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:04,160
to bring in professionals to inspect
the premises

200
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:06,640
and decide whether anything
had to be fixed

201
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,880
or it was the result of improper use.

202
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:12,400
It should be OK if we don't have
another typhoon.

203
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:13,920
Look, I'm in a hurry.

204
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:16,880
Here.

205
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:20,800
Bravo, Sis!

206
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,560
Luckily, I ran into you.

207
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,160
Or else she's likely to scare you

208
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,600
and you'd let her deduct money
from the rent

209
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:26,640
and we'd be in trouble.

210
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,680
I know.

211
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,240
Some people pick on targets to bully.

212
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,400
Next time you run into a tenant like that,

213
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:34,240
tell them you can't make decisions.

214
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,360
You'll need to call Grandpa, OK?

215
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:38,080
Can I call you?

216
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,520
Definitely not!

217
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,280
I don't want to get involved.

218
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,480
I'm only doing this for you.

219
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:47,280
Also, cut your bad habit of being late.

220
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,880
Or you'll give people an excuse

221
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,440
to use that against you, understand?

222
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:55,280
Remember we're seeing a movie
the day after tomorrow?

223
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:57,040
Don't be late.

224
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:00,400
You're right...I won't be late.

225
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,720
Let me get that for you.

226
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:04,080
Good boy!

227
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,200
I'll let you in on a secret.

228
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:05,760
What?

229
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,840
I didn't count the money.

230
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:08,720
You didn't?

231
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:11,200
You're dead if Grandpa found out!

232
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:25,800
Father, I drew a snail. Is it pretty?

233
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:26,960
Yes...

234
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:30,720
I'm very tired. Go play over there.

235
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:31,440
I need to rest.

236
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:37,360
Grandpa! Papa!
Hey!

237
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,600
You came home together?
Chung B, you're home?

238
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:42,400
I saw a tenant bullying Chung,

239
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:44,240
and I rescued him.
Come draw with me...

240
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:47,520
Here? Use yellow.

241
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,560
Would you like a candy?

242
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,480
Yes! Sis stood up for me.

243
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:56,800
Really?
No, thanks.

244
00:10:57,320 --> 00:11:01,440
If you want to draw better, do it upstairs.

245
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,440
Upstairs is even better?

246
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,560
Yes!

247
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:07,040
OK, I'll go upstairs.

248
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:07,680
Yes!

249
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:08,720
I...

250
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:16,240
Chung, don't do those childish things
with your Papa anymore.

251
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:19,600
Try to learn from your sister.

252
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:22,080
Make yourself useful, OK?

253
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:27,440
Tai-di, you're a smart girl.

254
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:29,760
You're good at school and at work.

255
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,440
But what a shame you're a girl.

256
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:33,200
You will get married someday,

257
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:35,040
you can't take over the family.

258
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:38,320
Try to make time for your brother

259
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:41,360
so he can be smart like you, OK?

260
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:44,320
Make him useful, understand?

261
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,920
Teach him. I'm going upstairs.

262
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:54,800
Sis, if only I'm half as capable as you are,

263
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:56,880
I'd be very happy already.

264
00:11:57,400 --> 00:12:00,320
My Boss wanted to send me overseas

265
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,240
and work for a law firm we have
a joint venture with.

266
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,000
I guess it won't be happening now.

267
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,280
Why?

268
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,360
I need money.

269
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,880
Didn't you hear what Grandpa said?

270
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:11,680
When I have money,

271
00:12:11,880 --> 00:12:13,840
I'll give you money to go to school.

272
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,200
For as long as you like.

273
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:16,880
When you have money?

274
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:18,480
You didn't have much schooling,

275
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,360
how can you make money?

276
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,560
You can barely feed yourself.

277
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:21,920
Don't look down on me.

278
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:24,800
If I win the lottery,
I won't share it with you.

279
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:27,760
Oh, I'm so scared. I'm begging you...

280
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:30,480
If you win $20, give me $1, OK?

281
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:33,760
What a brat!

282
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,360
Pack your Papa's things.

283
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,320
Right!

284
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,720
Chau!
Yes?

285
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,000
No bird's nest today?

286
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,520
No more.

287
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:43,760
Why didn't you get more?

288
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:48,080
You knew Chi needs bird's nest every day
for nutrition

289
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:50,800
and to keep his mind active.

290
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:54,080
Madam Ping said Master Chi doesn't need it.

291
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:56,800
She said bird's nest has the same
nutritional value as tofu,

292
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:58,400
there's no need to waste money on it.

293
00:12:58,560 --> 00:12:59,440
Follow me.

294
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:00,160
What?

295
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:03,440
Why didn't you buy bird's nest?

296
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:05,360
Because it's useless.

297
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,560
What are these?

298
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,480
Vitamins.

299
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:11,680
Chi has been eating bird's nest
since he was little.

300
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,280
Who says it's useless?

301
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:14,880
If he has been eating since he was little

302
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,560
and he's still like this, it's useless.

303
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:19,600
Vitamins is what he needs.

304
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,600
This is the doctor's idea, not mine.

305
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:24,640
Nothing he eats can make him smarter.

306
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,240
He should try to do more things

307
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,440
to make him more independent.

308
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:28,960
You can cut back on anything,

309
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:31,040
but not Chi's expenses.

310
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:34,800
I also cut your fish maw.

311
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:38,000
You're too old, it'll give you indigestion

312
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:40,920
or you'll get stomachache or feel gloated.

313
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,720
You'll only waste money to see a doctor.

314
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,480
Are you cursing me?

315
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:47,760
You can't stop until I say so.

316
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:52,080
Chau, get me fish maw and bird's nest.

317
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:55,120
That's beyond Chau's grocery money.

318
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,920
But you can buy it with your own money.

319
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,280
I won't stop you.

320
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:02,000
But this is not included
in our grocery money.

321
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:04,800
Madam Han!

322
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,920
I've had enough.

323
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,880
I want to supervise the household expenses.

324
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,480
Please don't start any trouble.

325
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:19,360
We're too old to argue.

326
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:21,600
You don't need the hard work.

327
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:24,640
She fights me on everything.

328
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:25,840
She's a thorn in my flesh.

329
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,600
She's a real piece of work.

330
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:31,920
She's young and is bound to
do things differently.

331
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:35,360
The house is newer and more stylish.

332
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,920
She kept the house clean and tidy

333
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:40,080
and took good care of Chi and Chung.

334
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,440
What more do you want?

335
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,200
Since you put her in charge of
the household expenses,

336
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,720
she's becoming more domineering.

337
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:48,080
You saw the way she talked to me.

338
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:51,840
Now she wants to cut the tonic
for Chi and me.

339
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:55,120
She made Chi wear those cheap underwear

340
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,360
while she's getting all dressed up.

341
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,720
I bet she embezzled the money.

342
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:01,840
I want to oversee the
household expenses again.

343
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:04,800
Will you stop causing trouble?

344
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:08,640
I will check the books by month end. Relax!

345
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:12,080
Check? How? By turning a blind eye?

346
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:15,200
Let me ask you...you know English?

347
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:18,800
Can you type or turn on the computer?

348
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:25,360
Listen, you handpicked Ping yourself.

349
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,040
She was willing to marry Chi

350
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:29,360
and ran a tight ship around the house.

351
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:31,280
You should count your blessings.

352
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:33,280
Stop complaining.

353
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:36,800
If she won't listen, just live with it, OK?

354
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:40,000
I'm tired. I'll go shower.

355
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:45,600
If I wasn't worried about getting old

356
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,920
and no one would look after my son,

357
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,600
(21 years ago)

358
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:49,200
I would never have made this wrong move

359
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:51,200
and brought this jinx home.

360
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:52,000
Mrs. Cheung!

361
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:55,440
You made this for Chi?

362
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,760
I always pack lunch.

363
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:00,560
I know Cheung Wang-chi likes braised pork
with preserved vegetables

364
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:02,880
so I made a bit more for him.

365
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:07,040
I'm sorry, he ate your lunch.

366
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,280
We're sharing, right?

367
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,240
Yes!

368
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:12,080
Mrs. Cheung, why don't you sit down?

369
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,600
I'll get you some water.

370
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:14,480
Good.

371
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:21,280
Chi, do you like Miss Leung?

372
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:28,960
Shall I bring her home
and let her take care of you?

373
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,240
You want that?

374
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:34,960
Yes!

375
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:39,920
Miss Leung, thanks for looking after Chi
for the past two years.

376
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:43,680
This is something for you.

377
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:48,400
You have given me enough during
the festivals.

378
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:50,880
I can't accept something so expensive.

379
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:51,560
Please take it back.

380
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:55,760
Small diamonds like these are
not worth much.

381
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:59,200
I bought something for myself and
got this for you.

382
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:01,680
Thank you, Mrs. Cheung.

383
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:05,400
Taking care of Chi is very easy.

384
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,160
He's fun to be around with.

385
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:11,200
I remember you told me
your family is in debt

386
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:14,040
and you must work a few jobs to pay it off.

387
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:17,560
I think you and Chi get along very well.

388
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:20,840
You know he only has the IQ
of an 8-year-old.

389
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:24,880
But he's kind and good-tempered.

390
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,760
Since you've been looking after him,

391
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,920
why don't you marry him?

392
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:34,360
Then you won't have to look after
anyone else.

393
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,840
It never crossed my mind...

394
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:40,640
I will clear your family debt for you

395
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:45,120
and give you a considerable sum
as betrothal money.

396
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:49,440
You'll be rid of the debt

397
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:51,440
and live a worry-free life.

398
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:56,120
But there's no hurry. You can think it over.

399
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:01,600
I thought with her watching over Chi,

400
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:03,440
she can relieve my heavy burden

401
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,640
and take care of Chi for the rest
of his life.

402
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:07,760
She was doing so well at first.

403
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:11,320
But she became a different person
after Chung was born.

404
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:13,320
She doesn't care about Chi anymore.

405
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,240
Chi!

406
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:16,320
Ouch, Mom...

407
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,960
She gradually got out of hand.

408
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:21,760
Now, I still had to worry about Chi.

409
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:25,080
That woman completely ignored me.

410
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:30,800
Honey?

411
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,520
What now?

412
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,440
Kiss kiss...

413
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:38,360
Out of my way. I'm not in the mood.

414
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:42,400
Honey, kiss kiss...
I told you...

415
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:46,160
I'll teach you to say something.

416
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,800
I want you to say it to your mother.

417
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,160
If you can do it, we'll kiss kiss, OK?

418
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,120
OK!

419
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:54,360
I don't like bird's nest.

420
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,920
Don't make it anymore.

421
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:57,560
I'll take vitamins instead.

422
00:18:57,800 --> 00:19:00,600
I don't like bird's nest.

423
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:04,040
Don't make it anymore. I'll...

424
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,720
So long, I can't remember.

425
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:15,920
Can you remember now?

426
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:19,200
I don't like bird's nest.

427
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:20,320
Don't make it anymore.

428
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:22,640
I'll take vitamins instead.

429
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:24,080
Good!

430
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:26,040
Remember to tell your mother.

431
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:32,280
What now? I want to take a shower.

432
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,240
Together.

433
00:19:34,640 --> 00:19:36,160
When did we do that together?

434
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:37,440
You won't listen to me?

435
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:38,400
Then I'm not talking to you.

436
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:44,080
Don't forget those lines.

437
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:50,960
I don't like bird's nest.

438
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:53,200
Don't make it anymore.

439
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:56,640
I'll take vitamins instead.

440
00:19:57,160 --> 00:20:00,280
There you are...please put that in here.

441
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:01,440
Take that away.

442
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:04,720
This is my room. You can't have it.

443
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:06,120
I bought that. Please put it inside.

444
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:07,040
Take that away.

445
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:08,560
Don't you dare take my room.

446
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,800
You're not in charge around here.

447
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,120
I didn't take anything.

448
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,240
Father said I can have it.

449
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:13,920
I said no!

450
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:16,160
Settle this between yourselves.

451
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,200
We'll wait outside.

452
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:18,720
Take it away...
No...

453
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:20,400
I have had enough of you!

454
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:22,800
You have no say around here.

455
00:20:23,120 --> 00:20:24,400
I want you to leave.

456
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:26,360
I'd like to see you try.

457
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:29,560
Your husband, your son and
your grandson need me.

458
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,040
Did you ask them?

459
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:36,720
Nam, say something.

460
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,600
Is she out of line or what?

461
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:41,120
Don't be upset. Let's wait for Kwok.

462
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:45,880
Kin-kwok, I'm glad you're home.

463
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:48,960
She turned my mahjong room into a bedroom.

464
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:52,120
Will you shut up? I'm not feeling well.

465
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:54,040
I need to go lie down.

466
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,840
You've been drinking already?

467
00:20:57,240 --> 00:21:00,560
I'm not feeling well. My head hurts.

468
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:03,640
My chest feels tight. Just be quiet.

469
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:05,120
How can you give her the room?

470
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,800
What about me?

471
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,360
Father said he's not feeling well.

472
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:09,760
Leave him alone.

473
00:21:09,840 --> 00:21:10,960
Father, I'll help you upstairs.

474
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:13,200
Quit your act.

475
00:21:13,520 --> 00:21:14,960
Because you indulge her

476
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,280
she's pushing her luck.

477
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:17,920
She's never home, she neglects Chi

478
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,280
and is always contradicting me.

479
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:21,600
I won't have it. One of us will have to go.

480
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:22,720
If she doesn't, I will.

481
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:24,640
What do you say?

482
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:27,440
Shut up!

483
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,560
Father!

484
00:21:31,280 --> 00:21:33,440
Kin-kwok...don't scare me!
Father...

485
00:21:33,520 --> 00:21:34,120
I'll get an ambulance.

486
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:36,280
Well? Master Kwok!
Kin-kwok!

487
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:37,880
Father!

488
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:54,600
(Ancestor Cheung Kin-kwok)

489
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:02,040
Madam Han, don't think too much.

490
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:05,320
Have some water and don't be too sad.

491
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,840
Chung B!
Yes?

492
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:12,480
Where is Dad, now that he's dead?

493
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:16,400
Can he still see my draw?

494
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:19,880
It's your drawing.

495
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:22,600
I don't think Grandpa can see.

496
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:26,160
He should be in the sky.

497
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:30,320
They say people become stars when they die.

498
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:34,080
There are so many...Which one?

499
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:37,640
Let's look for one that's blinking.

500
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:39,200
That one should be Grandpa.

501
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,240
That one is blinking! Is that Dad?

502
00:22:46,560 --> 00:22:49,040
Yes, it should be.

503
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:52,160
Dad is so far away,

504
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:58,960
who's in charge when something happens?

505
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:06,560
Hurry up! Everyone is waiting.

506
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:10,360
Honey!
For future family meetings,

507
00:23:10,560 --> 00:23:12,640
I don't want anyone to be late.

508
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:17,680
As soon as Father is gone,

509
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:20,400
you assume you're the head of the family.

510
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:23,920
I need to set things straight.

511
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:28,360
Before the lawyer reads Kin-kwok's will,

512
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:31,080
I'm taking over the family.

513
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:35,680
I trust even after the will is read,

514
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,520
things won't be any different.

515
00:23:38,600 --> 00:23:41,520
Kin-kwok may be gone,

516
00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:45,880
all expenses and allowance
will be the same.

517
00:23:46,320 --> 00:23:50,520
But I noticed something questionable
about the household expenses.

518
00:23:51,040 --> 00:23:54,080
Why are we $20K short every month?

519
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,400
Ping, you need to explain.

520
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:59,200
Father already went through the books.

521
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,880
He found nothing wrong.

522
00:24:01,080 --> 00:24:03,440
Are you saying Kin-kwok took the money?

523
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:04,600
Impossible!

524
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:08,480
He gave you a separate allowance,

525
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:11,440
he won't dock it from the
household expenses.

526
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:14,720
He was partial towards you.

527
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:18,880
Don't use him as your excuse.

528
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:21,360
Every dollar you spent

529
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:23,600
must be accountable and necessary.

530
00:24:23,760 --> 00:24:25,280
You better explain.

531
00:24:26,040 --> 00:24:30,080
You're welcome to find out for yourself.

532
00:24:30,760 --> 00:24:33,920
Did you buy that diamond ring?

533
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:37,040
I helped Father with this and that

534
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:38,400
and followed him here and there.

535
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:40,160
I deserved a salary for it.

536
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:43,360
I bought it with my own money.

537
00:24:43,640 --> 00:24:46,640
Your salary can't afford that.

538
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:49,040
You bought a lot of jewelry
over the past two years.

539
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:51,280
Did you take money from the family?

540
00:24:51,600 --> 00:24:53,440
You better cough it up.

541
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:56,120
I deserved everything I had.

542
00:24:56,320 --> 00:24:57,680
I have a clear conscience.

543
00:24:58,040 --> 00:25:01,680
I'm hungry. Why don't I treat you
to a dim sum lunch?

544
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:05,640
Good. I'm hungry too. I want dim sum.

545
00:25:05,960 --> 00:25:08,400
Grandma, let's have dim sum.
Mom, I want dim sum...

546
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:12,480
Fine! I'm giving you a week

547
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:14,480
to make up for the missing money.

548
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,960
Maybe it won't take a week.

549
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,920
In a few days, things may be turned around.

550
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:22,320
You'll be begging me instead.

551
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:25,440
What does she mean turn around?

552
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:29,120
Did she find a rich sugar Daddy
to pay for her fancy clothes?

553
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,320
Tai-di?

554
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:31,640
What?

555
00:25:32,120 --> 00:25:33,840
You're never home.

556
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:38,240
When you go out, did you notice
people your Mom hang out with?

557
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:40,080
Or have you seen her out there?

558
00:25:40,280 --> 00:25:42,960
No. I never butt into your affairs.

559
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:45,200
Whenever I ask you...
Auntie Chau...

560
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:47,120
I can change the sheets myself.

561
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:50,000
Chau, I want my sheets changed.

562
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:51,360
Come to my room.

563
00:26:02,800 --> 00:26:03,680
Madam Han!

564
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:07,880
That wench said just now...

565
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:10,400
In less than a week, things will be
turned around

566
00:26:10,520 --> 00:26:11,840
and I would beg her.

567
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:13,360
What does that mean?

568
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:18,240
You asked her to pay back
the money in front of everyone,

569
00:26:18,320 --> 00:26:20,640
I think she was just bluffing.

570
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:25,200
She's capable of anything.

571
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:28,400
I think she must have done something.

572
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:30,120
Maybe not.

573
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:32,960
When you clean her room or do her laundry,

574
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:35,320
did you find anything suspicious?

575
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:38,600
That reminds me, yes!

576
00:26:38,840 --> 00:26:41,760
I found two invoices and a deposit slip.

577
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,120
One invoice is for gold jewelry.

578
00:26:43,320 --> 00:26:45,760
I found these in her pocket when
I took her clothes to the dry cleaner.

579
00:26:45,840 --> 00:26:46,400
See?

580
00:26:48,080 --> 00:26:50,880
She deposited $30K cash into her account?

581
00:26:51,040 --> 00:26:52,960
She doesn't have that much money.

582
00:26:53,320 --> 00:26:56,880
I'm thinking if someone out there
gave her the money.

583
00:26:57,080 --> 00:26:58,560
You think so too?

584
00:26:59,080 --> 00:27:03,600
Recently, she's always going out.

585
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:05,200
Did she go out to meet men?

586
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:07,880
Maybe what I saw was true.

587
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:09,200
But it can't be...

588
00:27:09,320 --> 00:27:10,560
What is it? Tell me.

589
00:27:10,760 --> 00:27:14,520
A few months ago, I saw Madam Ping
go out all dressed up.

590
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:16,760
Right before she left,
she pulled out her phone

591
00:27:16,840 --> 00:27:19,280
and something that looked like condoms
fell out onto the ground.

592
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:21,760
She quickly picked it up
and put it back into her bag.

593
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:23,920
Why didn't you tell me?

594
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:25,880
I only took a quick glance.

595
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:27,040
I wasn't sure if I really saw it.

596
00:27:27,120 --> 00:27:29,440
This is a very serious charge.

597
00:27:29,520 --> 00:27:30,560
I shouldn't shoot off my mouth.

598
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:34,080
How dare she made a cuckold out of my son!

599
00:27:34,520 --> 00:27:37,120
No wonder when I asked Chi...

600
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:38,760
...he gave me weird answers...

601
00:27:38,840 --> 00:27:40,360
Your wife is inside, why don't you go in?

602
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:45,200
No. She's changing. She won't let me see.

603
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:49,080
She won't let you see her change?

604
00:27:49,800 --> 00:27:53,040
What do you do at night?

605
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:55,360
Sleeping.

606
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:58,640
Anything else?

607
00:27:59,200 --> 00:28:06,000
Sing, draw, play with the snail...

608
00:28:06,080 --> 00:28:07,800
and sleep.

609
00:28:08,600 --> 00:28:11,120
No kiss kiss?

610
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:14,800
Yes, only if I behave.

611
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:17,280
Otherwise, no kiss kiss.

612
00:28:18,600 --> 00:28:23,440
When was the last time you did this?

613
00:28:23,560 --> 00:28:26,000
What is that?

614
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,920
Oh dear!

615
00:28:28,320 --> 00:28:31,680
They haven't?! Oh dear!

616
00:28:31,760 --> 00:28:34,080
Did Master Chi piss her off?

617
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:36,640
She leaves Chi behind in the house

618
00:28:36,760 --> 00:28:38,800
while she goes out all dressed up.

619
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:40,720
She must have a lover.

620
00:28:41,120 --> 00:28:42,960
That's why she won't let Chi touch her.

621
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:46,400
She said I'll be begging her.

622
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:49,360
Is it because she'll run off with her lover?

623
00:28:49,560 --> 00:28:52,080
I'll have to beg her to stay

624
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,760
and look after Chi and Chung?

625
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,680
Mom, what are you doing?

626
00:28:55,760 --> 00:28:57,080
You look like you're moving.

627
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:02,400
Didn't you see Grandma's attitude
towards me this morning?

628
00:29:03,080 --> 00:29:05,440
I don't think I can live here anymore.

629
00:29:06,120 --> 00:29:08,400
Grandpa used to put in a good word.

630
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,560
But now?

631
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:13,920
We're leaving once we get the money.

632
00:29:14,400 --> 00:29:18,880
No. What about Papa? You're leaving him?

633
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:21,440
I'll listen to you.

634
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:26,240
Grandpa always said the family
must stick together.

635
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:29,920
Quiet! Don't wake Papa.

636
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:31,200
Shouldn't you be in bed?

637
00:29:32,280 --> 00:29:33,920
We don't know what will happen.

638
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:35,360
We'll decide later.

639
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:37,200
OK!

640
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:39,840
Good night, Papa.

641
00:29:45,360 --> 00:29:48,880
Folks, you all have a copy of
an attachment,

642
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:51,640
listing the assets of the late
Mr. Cheung Kin-kwok

643
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:56,840
including this mansion in Ko Cho Village

644
00:29:56,960 --> 00:29:58,120
which is worth $30M

645
00:29:58,360 --> 00:30:02,240
and other land, shops and investments
worth around $70M.

646
00:30:02,520 --> 00:30:05,840
His total assets are worth $100M.

647
00:30:06,040 --> 00:30:08,000
According to Mr. Cheung's will,

648
00:30:08,160 --> 00:30:10,720
he left everything to one person,

649
00:30:10,800 --> 00:30:14,400
his grandson, Mr. Cheung Siu-chung.

650
00:30:17,080 --> 00:30:20,240
No way! Are you sure?

651
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:22,240
What about me and my son?

652
00:30:22,440 --> 00:30:23,880
It's written in his will.

653
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,440
But there's also one condition,

654
00:30:25,520 --> 00:30:27,920
Mr. Cheung Siu-chung must wait till
he's 21 years old

655
00:30:28,080 --> 00:30:29,560
before he can inherit the estate.

656
00:30:30,840 --> 00:30:34,840
When I'm dead, I'll leave you the mansion.

657
00:30:35,040 --> 00:30:36,720
That creep lied to me.

658
00:30:36,960 --> 00:30:40,320
But at least he left everything to Chung.

659
00:30:40,560 --> 00:30:43,800
Chung is my son, at least I got something.

660
00:30:44,080 --> 00:30:45,840
Unlike her, who has nothing.

661
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:48,720
Mr. Lam, can I turn it down?

662
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,520
This is old Mr. Cheung's last wish.

663
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:55,680
He wants you to decide what to do
with the money.

664
00:30:55,800 --> 00:30:57,880
He believed you would look after the family

665
00:30:58,080 --> 00:30:59,640
and would know what to do.

666
00:30:59,840 --> 00:31:02,400
He let him decide what to do with $100M?

667
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:04,720
He has limited intelligence.

668
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:07,760
The money is as good as gone.

669
00:31:09,080 --> 00:31:10,720
Thank you, Mr. Lam. I'll walk you out.

670
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:14,960
I don't understand why Kin-kwok
would put that in the will.

671
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:16,760
Chi and I have nothing.

672
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:18,720
It must be you.

673
00:31:19,360 --> 00:31:22,280
You did something to make him
leave a will like this.

674
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:25,200
Father was always keen on his bloodline.

675
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:27,680
Leaving everything to Chung wasn't so bad.

676
00:31:27,960 --> 00:31:29,440
I won't get any of it either.

677
00:31:30,040 --> 00:31:33,600
Relax! You'll live your remaining years
in comfort.

678
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:36,400
It really doesn't matter.

679
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:38,840
Chung is the only male heir.

680
00:31:39,040 --> 00:31:42,640
He'll take care of all of you.

681
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:47,600
It should be a well thought out decision
by Grandpa.

682
00:31:47,800 --> 00:31:51,120
What are you talking about?

683
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:53,120
I don't understand.

684
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:58,040
Mom, why are you so angry?

685
00:31:58,520 --> 00:32:01,040
I told you things may be turned around.

686
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:04,840
I guess even Father had no intention
to put you in charge.

687
00:32:05,320 --> 00:32:07,440
Why? Not resolved?

688
00:32:07,880 --> 00:32:10,880
Go to Hell and ask him about it.

689
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:12,640
What did you say?

690
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:15,440
Neither of us will get the money.

691
00:32:15,520 --> 00:32:16,960
There's no need to argue.

692
00:32:17,160 --> 00:32:18,880
Father was so thoughtful.

693
00:32:19,600 --> 00:32:22,400
Chi, time to go to the DAC.

694
00:32:23,080 --> 00:32:25,080
I don't want to stay and talk.

695
00:32:28,960 --> 00:32:30,880
Here...carry this.

696
00:32:43,720 --> 00:32:46,600
If Madam Ping found out
we're searching her room,

697
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:48,120
she'll throw a fit.

698
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:50,480
She took Chi to the DAC.

699
00:32:50,560 --> 00:32:51,440
She won't be home soon.

700
00:32:51,640 --> 00:32:53,640
We must find proof of her
taking on a lover.

701
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:56,520
Even if we find any proof, what can we do?

702
00:32:56,600 --> 00:32:58,400
Master Kwok gave everything to Chung

703
00:32:58,480 --> 00:32:59,680
and Chung listens to Madam Ping.

704
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:01,920
She'll eventually get the money.

705
00:33:02,080 --> 00:33:03,920
If Chung is not a Cheung,

706
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:06,280
Kin-kwok's estate will go to an outsider.

707
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:08,720
I don't care if we go to court,

708
00:33:08,800 --> 00:33:10,240
I must get the money back.

709
00:33:24,120 --> 00:33:25,280
Look at this!

710
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:28,000
This is a hotel keycard.

711
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:29,880
So?

712
00:33:29,960 --> 00:33:32,080
She kept a regular room at a hotel

713
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:34,000
to rendezvous with her lover.

714
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:36,560
She cheated on Chi!

715
00:33:36,760 --> 00:33:38,760
Look at this!

716
00:33:38,960 --> 00:33:43,520
September 15?! That was the day
Kin-kwok died.

717
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:47,680
This is a couple package.

718
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:50,200
She had a tryst that morning.

719
00:33:50,520 --> 00:33:53,600
She had no shame.

720
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:56,480
No wonder she had money for the jewelry.

721
00:33:56,560 --> 00:33:57,760
She had a sugar Daddy.

722
00:33:57,960 --> 00:33:59,360
What should we do now?

723
00:33:59,560 --> 00:34:02,200
We must find this man

724
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:06,080
and see if Chung is Chi's son.

725
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:14,000
Chung, I always loved you like a son

726
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:16,560
and I always will. Don't worry.

727
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:19,920
I need to pee.

728
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:22,240
I'll go with you.

729
00:34:22,440 --> 00:34:25,640
No, I'm OK.

730
00:34:25,800 --> 00:34:27,280
Be careful.

731
00:34:34,400 --> 00:34:35,840
Don't be too heartbroken.

732
00:34:39,760 --> 00:34:45,160
That hotel is near Nam's office.

733
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:46,480
I think so.

734
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:48,800
But maybe not.

735
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:51,920
The day Master Kwok died,

736
00:34:52,040 --> 00:34:54,080
I think they came back together.

737
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:56,800
They came from their tryst.

738
00:34:57,360 --> 00:35:00,960
Master Nam is family, he wouldn't dare.

739
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:03,040
I thought it was weird

740
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:08,000
he asked to be Chung's godfather back then.

741
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:12,800
Nam doted on Chung since he was little.

742
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:18,080
Now that you mentioned it, it's probable.

743
00:35:18,440 --> 00:35:21,360
Is it possible Chung is Nam's son?

744
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:30,880
Ouch! Why did you pull my hair? It hurts.

745
00:35:31,080 --> 00:35:32,560
Exactly! What's wrong with you?

746
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:35,120
Why did you pull out his hair?

747
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:37,240
Why? Does it break your heart?

748
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:38,240
What are you saying?

749
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:41,840
Your heart is aching for your lover? I know.

750
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:44,400
What lover? You better explain yourself.

751
00:35:44,720 --> 00:35:49,280
I know he's Chung's father, not Chi.

752
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:51,240
Are you crazy? Watch your mouth!

753
00:35:51,320 --> 00:35:53,640
Be careful with what you say, Cousin.

754
00:35:53,720 --> 00:35:55,280
Is there a misunderstanding?

755
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:58,760
I know all about you two.

756
00:35:59,640 --> 00:36:01,920
Chung is not a Cheung,

757
00:36:02,120 --> 00:36:03,440
He's your illegitimate son.

758
00:36:03,640 --> 00:36:05,640
Grandma, calm down.

759
00:36:05,720 --> 00:36:08,680
I'm definitely Papa's son.

760
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:11,520
I need your hair for a DNA test.

761
00:36:11,720 --> 00:36:12,960
I suggest you stop doing this.

762
00:36:13,080 --> 00:36:14,560
Chung is definitely a Cheung.

763
00:36:14,680 --> 00:36:16,480
Why? You have something to hide?

764
00:36:16,560 --> 00:36:18,880
Can't show your face when
the results come out?

765
00:36:19,080 --> 00:36:20,800
I must expose you.

766
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:22,960
I want the world to know
the shameful thing you did.

767
00:36:26,600 --> 00:36:30,760
Fine! You want to know? I'll tell you.

768
00:36:33,640 --> 00:36:38,560
You're right. Chung is not Chi's son.

769
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:42,880
You finally admit it!

770
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:45,640
You lied to us for over 20 years.

771
00:36:46,400 --> 00:36:47,640
How vicious of you!

772
00:36:47,720 --> 00:36:49,680
I said Chung is not Chi's son.

773
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:51,760
But I didn't say he's not a Cheung.

774
00:36:52,200 --> 00:36:53,360
What are you trying to say?

775
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:55,200
Listen carefully.

776
00:36:56,360 --> 00:37:01,360
Chung is my son with your husband,
my father-in-law.

777
00:37:02,600 --> 00:37:06,480
Cheung Siu-chung is Cheung Kin-kwok's son.

778
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:16,960
Here's the DNA report. See for yourself.

779
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:24,680
How do I know if this is real?

780
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,000
You want to know?

781
00:37:26,200 --> 00:37:29,760
Go in and pull a hair from Father
and compare that with Chung's.

782
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:32,240
Chung is part of the Cheung family.

783
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:33,760
He deserves what he got.

784
00:37:34,840 --> 00:37:39,240
Last time you asked me where
the jewelry came from.

785
00:37:39,640 --> 00:37:41,160
They were from your husband.

786
00:37:41,640 --> 00:37:45,040
And the missing $20K every month?

787
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:48,720
That was a gift from him. Happy now?

788
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,960
He said you two had things to do.

789
00:37:51,680 --> 00:37:53,280
And you went to a tryst in a hotel.

790
00:37:53,520 --> 00:37:56,960
Yes, we came back together that day.

791
00:37:57,040 --> 00:37:58,960
He told you he wasn't feeling well.

792
00:37:59,240 --> 00:38:02,880
Why? Because he took medication
and was too aroused.

793
00:38:03,080 --> 00:38:04,800
But you badgered him with questions

794
00:38:04,880 --> 00:38:05,640
and gave him a stroke.

795
00:38:05,720 --> 00:38:07,360
You killed him.

796
00:38:07,560 --> 00:38:09,680
You killed my husband.

797
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:12,160
You messed with him and cheated on Chi.

798
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:14,480
I'm the victim here.

799
00:38:14,720 --> 00:38:16,400
You couldn't please your husband.

800
00:38:16,480 --> 00:38:17,720
I had to pick up after you.

801
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:20,680
It was your premeditated plan

802
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:22,320
to marry into this family and
steal our money.

803
00:38:22,720 --> 00:38:25,920
That's why you had the DNA test,
you cheap whore!

804
00:38:26,160 --> 00:38:27,640
I was worried once Father is dead,

805
00:38:27,720 --> 00:38:29,680
you'll frame me for something
and send me away.

806
00:38:29,880 --> 00:38:31,920
Of course I had to do the DNA test

807
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:32,960
to protect Chung.

808
00:38:33,080 --> 00:38:35,640
Chung is part of the family and
deserves a share of the fortune.

809
00:38:44,920 --> 00:38:46,960
Cheung Kin-kwok, get up!

810
00:38:47,040 --> 00:38:49,200
You won't get away with what you did...
Madam...

811
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,880
He's dead...don't do this...

812
00:38:50,960 --> 00:38:53,240
Cousin, show some respect for the dead.

813
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,560
Get up...
Madam Han!

814
00:38:54,640 --> 00:38:56,200
You have guests. Are you ready?

815
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:57,040
Coming!

816
00:38:57,160 --> 00:38:59,920
Madam, guests are arriving. Stop crying.

817
00:39:00,560 --> 00:39:02,480
Do your crying at home.

818
00:39:02,560 --> 00:39:04,120
Father was well respected.

819
00:39:04,200 --> 00:39:06,800
You better get this show on the road.

820
00:39:08,400 --> 00:39:11,440
Honey, what's going on?

821
00:39:11,600 --> 00:39:14,680
Guests are arriving. Let's go outside...

822
00:39:18,040 --> 00:39:20,400
What's done is done, about Master Kwok,

823
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:21,760
don't be so upset.

824
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:24,240
Take it easy and mind your health.

825
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:28,320
Don't remind me of that creep!

826
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:32,640
Grandma, please don't be angry.

827
00:39:32,720 --> 00:39:34,160
It's bad for you.

828
00:39:34,680 --> 00:39:37,720
Have some honey lemon with tangerine peel.

829
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:41,040
Stop calling me that. I'm not your Grandma.

830
00:39:41,400 --> 00:39:44,480
You're the illegitimate son my husband
had with that tramp.

831
00:39:45,120 --> 00:39:48,000
I know what Mom did was wrong.

832
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:50,800
But can you not be angry with me?

833
00:39:50,880 --> 00:39:53,360
Get out! I don't want to see you!

834
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,280
Don't come into my room anymore.

835
00:39:55,360 --> 00:39:56,560
And stop calling me Grandma.

836
00:39:56,920 --> 00:40:00,080
Chung, stop calling her Grandma.

837
00:40:00,160 --> 00:40:01,240
It's jarring to her ears.

838
00:40:01,640 --> 00:40:04,000
Try not to show up before Madam Han.

839
00:40:04,080 --> 00:40:06,000
You're a thorn in her flesh.

840
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:08,320
Run along now...

841
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:17,640
Chung B...what's wrong?

842
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:20,880
Are you upset?

843
00:40:21,160 --> 00:40:26,760
Papa...no, I shouldn't call you Papa.

844
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:30,480
I should not...I don't know
what to call you.

845
00:40:30,760 --> 00:40:36,240
Why? You're my son.

846
00:40:36,560 --> 00:40:40,880
No. Our relationship is gross.

847
00:40:41,120 --> 00:40:43,040
What?
I don't know what to say.

848
00:40:43,120 --> 00:40:44,480
Chi...

849
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:46,760
Go play by yourself.

850
00:40:47,880 --> 00:40:52,480
I hate you. Why did you do it?
Chung...

851
00:40:52,560 --> 00:40:53,360
Listen to me.

852
00:40:53,840 --> 00:40:56,000
Calm down and listen to me.

853
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:58,960
It's not what you think.

854
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:01,360
I'm the victim here.

855
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:04,640
Back then, I had to pay a family debt,

856
00:41:04,720 --> 00:41:06,120
that's why I married into this family.

857
00:41:06,600 --> 00:41:08,160
People sit in judgment over me

858
00:41:08,680 --> 00:41:10,680
and accused me of marrying Chi for money.

859
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:14,080
I was under a lot of pressure and
I was unhappy.

860
00:41:15,480 --> 00:41:17,520
Luckily Father was highly respected

861
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:22,400
and he was very nice towards me, but...

862
00:41:23,640 --> 00:41:25,840
Father, what are you doing here?

863
00:41:26,200 --> 00:41:31,120
Father...no...

864
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:36,400
I felt dirty and wanted to kill myself.

865
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:39,200
But soon I found out
I was pregnant with you.

866
00:41:39,720 --> 00:41:41,160
I didn't want to lose you.

867
00:41:42,160 --> 00:41:45,360
I had nowhere to go,
so I was forced to stay.

868
00:41:46,080 --> 00:41:48,400
I put up with the pain and shame

869
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,360
to raise you.

870
00:41:51,880 --> 00:41:52,800
I don't want to know...

871
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:54,800
Stop! I don't want to listen...

872
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:57,920
Don't say it...
Chung!

873
00:42:14,360 --> 00:42:16,480
(Two days after Chung left home)

874
00:42:16,560 --> 00:42:18,320
Why didn't Chung B come home?

875
00:42:18,720 --> 00:42:22,560
He left me a message telling me
he wants to be alone.

876
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:24,160
Don't worry about him.

877
00:42:24,440 --> 00:42:27,440
Chung B's birthday is coming up.

878
00:42:27,520 --> 00:42:30,320
I want to celebrate with him.
